1
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:03,840
All right!

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:05,100
Satomura & Yao

3
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:05,100
Hinase & Hananoi

4
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,120
Nice one, Satomi-san!

5
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,030
I just got lucky.

6
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:09,360
Have you been practicing or something?

7
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,500
No way!

8
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:13,480
It's our turn next. Let's go for it, okay?

9
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:19,420
Hananoi-kun, have you been bowling before?

10
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,160
Yeah, a few times.

11
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,420
And you, Hotako?

12
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:27,350
I've been a few times too.
But I always throw gutter balls.

13
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:28,950
Aw, you'll do fine.

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:38,510
Satomura & Yao

15
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:38,510
Hinase & Hananoi

16
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:41,040
I'm sorry.

17
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,270
Relax, relax.

18
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:54,400
I did it!

19
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,290
Hota-chan, Hota-chan!

20
00:02:36,390 --> 00:02:38,630
This is so much fun!

21
00:02:36,550 --> 00:02:43,010
Episode 11

22
00:02:36,550 --> 00:02:43,010
Our First Campus Expedition

23
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:42,010
I haven't hung out with anyone 
like this since I moved to Tokyo!

24
00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:47,020
To tell you the truth, I haven't made 
a lot of friends in college.

25
00:02:48,050 --> 00:02:54,350
People get creeped out when I bring up 
my hobbies, so I'm never sure what to talk about.

26
00:02:54,930 --> 00:03:00,270
But I've always wanted to go out 
and let loose like this!

27
00:03:00,270 --> 00:03:03,580
So thanks for inviting me today.

28
00:03:03,990 --> 00:03:09,490
I-I actually always really enjoy talking 
to you, Satomura-san. It's so fun!

29
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:17,420
Hota-chan! You're the cutest 
coworker I've ever had!

30
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,420
I guess that makes another one.

31
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:25,470
That next! Let's do that!

32
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:28,190
When the sign appears, 
hit the drum with these sticks.

33
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:30,240
We shouldn't just stand here watching.

34
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:32,270
Wanna play something together?

35
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,040
Nah.

36
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,750
Oh, don't say that.

37
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:38,610
Besides, I need to talk to you
 about something.

38
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:44,130
We're playing ping-pong at an arcade?

39
00:03:44,130 --> 00:03:45,710
Just one game.

40
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:52,550
If I win, you have to tell 
Hotako all about your past.

41
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:56,870
<i>So that's the reason he 
forced me to come today.</i>

42
00:03:58,070 --> 00:04:00,420
I said you should tell her if you want.

43
00:04:01,950 --> 00:04:05,470
You know, man, I really don't get you.

44
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:09,280
Whenever Hotako's not around, 
you act like a total jerk towards me.

45
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:13,070
Aren't you worried I might 
tell her about that?

46
00:04:13,070 --> 00:04:14,730
Or do you actually want me to?

47
00:04:15,010 --> 00:04:19,100
And "I can tell her if I want"? 
Don't try to put that on me.

48
00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:23,110
She wouldn't want to hear something
so important about you from someone else.

49
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:31,520
If I win, you're never 
gonna bring it up again.

50
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:34,110
We did it!

51
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:37,170
I'm so sorry. I was holding you back.

52
00:04:37,170 --> 00:04:42,480
No way! I've never gone to an arcade 
with friends before. This is super fun.

53
00:04:43,930 --> 00:04:47,000
Hey, two really hot guys are 
playing ping-pong together!

54
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,550
Let's go watch.

55
00:04:48,550 --> 00:04:49,260
Yeah!

56
00:04:49,690 --> 00:04:50,580
Huh?

57
00:04:59,330 --> 00:05:00,670
You're pretty good!

58
00:05:00,670 --> 00:05:03,580
Wanna play with Hotako 
and Satomi after this?

59
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:07,070
You're still saying "Hotako this,
 Hotako that." Shut the hell up.

60
00:05:07,530 --> 00:05:08,440
Whoa!

61
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:14,380
Didn't she tell you 
to stop calling her that?

62
00:05:16,130 --> 00:05:18,860
She said I could take my time
making the switch.

63
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:23,160
That she knows how hard it is 
to start calling someone a different name.

64
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,650
Yes!

65
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:31,700
Why the hell are you always sticking 
your nose into everything?

66
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:37,540
Yeah, I can see why it 
might bother you. Sorry.

67
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:40,650
But I've been friends with 
Hotako for a long time.

68
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:44,810
I just don't want to see 
her get hurt, you know?

69
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:48,930
You don't want to see her get hurt, huh?

70
00:05:49,790 --> 00:05:52,590
Hananoi-kun? Yao-kun?

71
00:05:52,590 --> 00:05:54,750
Hotako... Oh!

72
00:05:56,060 --> 00:05:58,400
Game over. I win.

73
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:01,300
Hey! That wasn't fair at all.

74
00:06:02,170 --> 00:06:04,600
You don't want to see her hurt?

75
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:07,100
You're the last person I
want to hear that from.

76
00:06:09,590 --> 00:06:13,450
Were you guys competing? 
I wish I could've seen it!

77
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:18,300
All right, we have to get to work soon.

78
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:19,340
Have a nice shift!

79
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:29,990
<i>I wonder what he and Yao-kun 
were talking about.</i>

80
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:33,410
What do you want to do now?

81
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:35,570
Hmm...

82
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,060
Wha—

83
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,300
Hotaru-chan?

84
00:06:42,010 --> 00:06:43,520
Ow, ow, ow.

85
00:06:45,050 --> 00:06:46,500
Sorry if it stings a little.

86
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:47,870
Oh, I can do that—

87
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:49,230
I'll take care of it.

88
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,190
I want to do it.

89
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:01,940
Hananoi-kun, did you have fun today?

90
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:04,770
Yeah, I did.

91
00:07:04,770 --> 00:07:07,900
It's nice to go out like that sometimes.

92
00:07:09,630 --> 00:07:13,580
Hotaru-chan, you seemed all right today.

93
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:14,210
Huh?

94
00:07:14,570 --> 00:07:17,980
You told me before that things 
are weird between you and Yao.

95
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:20,700
I started to wonder if something happened.

96
00:07:24,180 --> 00:07:29,610
U-Um, remember when I told you 
about the friend who cut my hair?

97
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:35,110
As a matter of fact,
 the boy she liked was Yao-kun.

98
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:41,430
So I still get a little 
scared when I'm with him.

99
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:46,760
It must be awful to have someone
be so awkward around you

100
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,690
when you've done nothing wrong.

101
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:55,080
Yao-kun is really nice, so he tries 
to pretend like it doesn't bother him.

102
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,560
I finally realized that recently.

103
00:07:58,570 --> 00:08:01,940
So I thought today would be 
the perfect opportunity.

104
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:05,250
I'm glad I looked normal.

105
00:08:07,330 --> 00:08:09,020
I guess that explains it.

106
00:08:09,470 --> 00:08:11,840
Wait, were you worried about me?

107
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:18,750
No, it's something else. It's not about you,
 Hotaru-chan. It's a personal problem.

108
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:22,430
<i>She wouldn't want to hear something
so important about you from someone else.</i>

109
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:26,180
You really are amazing, Hotaru-chan.

110
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:29,470
You put other people's 
feelings before your own.

111
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:31,990
You keep growing as a person.

112
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,370
Hananoi-kun?

113
00:08:35,330 --> 00:08:37,370
But I still need to get stronger.

114
00:08:39,150 --> 00:08:43,600
What do I have to do 
to get a clear head again?

115
00:08:47,910 --> 00:08:49,000
Maybe the sooner...

116
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:55,050
I make you completely mine, 
the sooner I'll be able to relax.

117
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:09,610
That was close.

118
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:14,260
I almost broke the promise I made to you.

119
00:09:16,540 --> 00:09:17,720
<i>One day,</i>

120
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:21,630
<i>when we finally share a real kiss,</i>

121
00:09:22,650 --> 00:09:25,610
<i>I want you to be as elated as I will be.</i>

122
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:45,120
I'm sorry. I put you in an 
awkward position again.

123
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:49,790
I'm such an idiot. I keep doing this to you.

124
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:53,400
<i>No, that isn't it.</i>

125
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,200
<i>I don't think that's why I just did that.</i>

126
00:09:58,650 --> 00:10:01,270
<i>This has happened a bunch of times before.</i>

127
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,500
<i>My body just moves on its own...</i>

128
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,950
<i>But I can't really put that 
feeling into words yet.</i>

129
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:12,560
Um, Hananoi-kun?

130
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:13,500
Hotaru-chan.

131
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,690
Listen, I...

132
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:21,100
There's something I haven't told you yet.

133
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:35,730
A spring-exclusive cafeteria delicacy

134
00:10:30,310 --> 00:10:32,980
This sells out in seconds every year.

135
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:35,380
I want to try it,
but I doubt I'll get a chance.

136
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:39,370
Well, the third-years do have an advantage
in terms of proximity.

137
00:10:39,950 --> 00:10:42,710
I went through the same thing
 in middle school.

138
00:10:42,710 --> 00:10:43,690
Huh?

139
00:10:43,690 --> 00:10:46,090
Your middle school had a cafeteria?

140
00:10:46,090 --> 00:10:48,370
Yeah. I lived in the dorms.

141
00:10:48,370 --> 00:10:50,660
Y-You lived in a dorm?!

142
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:56,730
Sorry again. I still haven't told 
you much about my past, have I?

143
00:10:56,730 --> 00:10:58,160
That's okay.

144
00:10:58,160 --> 00:11:00,940
I should have asked sooner 
but was holding back.

145
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:04,630
Is it all right if I ask a little more?

146
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:08,140
Of course! That's what we promised.

147
00:11:09,370 --> 00:11:14,890
<i>That's right. We decided to embark
 on another new endeavor.</i>

148
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:17,420
Listen, I...

149
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:19,910
There's something I haven't told you yet.

150
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,060
In truth, I—

151
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:29,560
W-Wait! Is this something 
I really need to hear?

152
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:35,250
I mean, the way you look right now, 
Hananoi-kun... I don't know.

153
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:38,130
You look like it's the end 
of the world or something.

154
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:40,300
Oh... Sorry.

155
00:11:40,790 --> 00:11:44,170
I guess just got a little nervous...

156
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:49,120
Well, then can you give me the gist 
of what this is about?

157
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,930
Th-The gist of it?

158
00:11:50,930 --> 00:11:52,180
Yeah, yeah!

159
00:11:52,520 --> 00:12:00,070
Um, actually, it's about how 
lame I used to be.

160
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:05,080
I mean, I couldn't blame you
if it made you hate me.

161
00:12:06,370 --> 00:12:08,620
Wait, it's one of those?

162
00:12:09,210 --> 00:12:12,420
In that case, you don't need 
to force yourself to tell me.

163
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:15,660
But I feel like I really should...

164
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:20,520
There are lots of things you don't know 
about me that might make you hate me, too.

165
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,110
Tons and tons of them.

166
00:12:23,030 --> 00:12:28,950
I know we're going out, but it's still 
going to be hard to tell each other

167
00:12:28,950 --> 00:12:30,630
every last secret about ourselves.

168
00:12:31,530 --> 00:12:35,310
But you told me about Yao, Hotaru-chan.

169
00:12:35,310 --> 00:12:38,380
Well, I wanted you to know about that.

170
00:12:39,350 --> 00:12:41,510
Hmm, but okay.

171
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:46,100
Maybe there are things I should tell 
you even if I don't want to.

172
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:48,400
This is kinda difficult.

173
00:12:49,570 --> 00:12:50,830
Oh, I know!

174
00:12:50,830 --> 00:12:55,370
How about we start asking more of the 
questions we have about each other instead?

175
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:58,640
Huh? Of course that's fine with me.

176
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:03,880
I tend to forget, but we've only officially been going out for two months!

177
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:03,880
I mean, there are still a whole lot of 
things we don't know about each other yet!

178
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:08,150
So, okay, why don't we start 
with the little stuff

179
00:13:08,150 --> 00:13:11,580
and practice talking about 
ourselves more and more?

180
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:16,010
Bit by bit, you know? L-Like beginners,
since that's what we are.

181
00:13:18,330 --> 00:13:20,030
Let's start off easy.

182
00:13:24,450 --> 00:13:25,530
Huh.

183
00:13:26,090 --> 00:13:29,770
So you had to clean and do 
your own laundry in the dorm?

184
00:13:29,770 --> 00:13:31,290
Oh, Hotaru?

185
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:34,390
What a surprise seeing you here.

186
00:13:34,390 --> 00:13:36,070
Shibamu, are you with your club?

187
00:13:36,070 --> 00:13:38,160
Yeah, we're taking a break.

188
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,970
Shibamu is in the kendo club.

189
00:13:40,970 --> 00:13:42,080
What are you two up to?

190
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:47,920
Um, I was planning to hang 
out with Hananoi-kun today,

191
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,530
but it's really pouring outside,

192
00:13:49,530 --> 00:13:52,360
so I guess we're on a campus 
expedition until it stops.

193
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,640
Sounds like you're having fun.

194
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:57,130
Shibamura-san, we're about to start again.

195
00:13:57,810 --> 00:13:59,340
Oh, right.

196
00:13:59,340 --> 00:14:00,550
I'll see you later.

197
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:07,360
<i>Wait, Hozumi-sensei? I didn't know 
he was the kendo club advisor.</i>

198
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:12,750
What extracurriculars did you do 
in middle school, Hananoi-kun?

199
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:14,000
Track and field.

200
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:17,540
Wow! So you like running?

201
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:21,480
I was really weak when I was a kid. 
I wanted to get in better shape.

202
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,990
I see.

203
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:26,040
Oh! Kyo-chan!

204
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:26,870
Hmm?

205
00:14:27,330 --> 00:14:29,810
Hotaru? What's up?

206
00:14:31,130 --> 00:14:32,390
Well, actually...

207
00:14:32,390 --> 00:14:34,070
Over here!

208
00:14:34,070 --> 00:14:35,140
Go center!

209
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,270
Oh, wow!

210
00:14:41,270 --> 00:14:43,730
Yeah. Pretty cool, huh?

211
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:47,620
I wish I could come watch him every day.

212
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:51,350
Oh? Hey, you two! And Hibiki!

213
00:14:51,350 --> 00:14:52,560
Who?

214
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:54,450
It's that famous second-year kid.

215
00:14:54,450 --> 00:14:56,380
He's in my class.

216
00:14:56,380 --> 00:14:59,870
But you're making your girl 
wait on you again?

217
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:01,790
Must be nice having a girlfriend.

218
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:05,040
You have someone to comfort 
you after a hard workout.

219
00:15:05,470 --> 00:15:07,750
So, what's up? Planning on joining the team?

220
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:09,760
You're so tall, Hananoi, we'd love to ha—

221
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:13,270
You should get back to it.

222
00:15:14,650 --> 00:15:16,930
Even his classmates think he's a dork!

223
00:15:16,930 --> 00:15:18,130
Hilarious!

224
00:15:18,770 --> 00:15:22,900
You got me. He always 
gives me the cold shoulder.

225
00:15:23,250 --> 00:15:24,320
See you later.

226
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:28,310
Oh, and sorry, Hibiki. I'm gonna be late, 
so you should go on home.

227
00:15:28,310 --> 00:15:28,900
Sure.

228
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:32,570
I never see him like this in class...

229
00:15:32,570 --> 00:15:35,540
Kei-chan actually has it pretty tough.

230
00:15:35,910 --> 00:15:39,720
In his first year, he jumped ahead 
and became a regular player.

231
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:42,550
He has trouble getting along
 with his older teammates.

232
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:45,040
So thank you, Hananoi-kun.

233
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:48,480
If he'd kept on blabbing, 
they would've teased him even more.

234
00:15:49,350 --> 00:15:51,620
I didn't do a thing.

235
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:56,090
I didn't really expect that.

236
00:15:57,020 --> 00:15:59,240
I guess Kuratani has his own problems.

237
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:05,970
<i>I get the feeling that Hananoi-kun doesn't 
really hate Keigo-kun after all.</i>

238
00:16:09,790 --> 00:16:15,540
Um, Hananoi-kun, has it always been your 
policy to avoid making friends?

239
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:18,790
No. I had some until middle school.

240
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:20,780
Oh, really?

241
00:16:20,780 --> 00:16:23,160
But there was only one 
I was really close with.

242
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:25,670
<i>Only one?!</i>

243
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:29,990
Wh-What were they like?

244
00:16:29,990 --> 00:16:31,160
Hmm...

245
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:42,540
<i>Maybe that's something he 
doesn't want to talk about.</i>

246
00:16:48,010 --> 00:16:52,000
He was a lot older than me.

247
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,890
Oh, the friend you just mentioned?

248
00:16:54,890 --> 00:16:55,640
Yeah.

249
00:16:56,540 --> 00:16:59,890
I was really rebellious in middle school.

250
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:03,950
When I said I wanted to get my 
ears pierced, he helped me out.

251
00:17:03,950 --> 00:17:05,070
Huh?

252
00:17:05,070 --> 00:17:08,470
If a middle schooler said that, 
most people would try to stop them.

253
00:17:08,850 --> 00:17:13,700
But he was a free spirit 
and didn't care much about stuff like that.

254
00:17:14,490 --> 00:17:19,350
But then he left without saying a word.

255
00:17:20,010 --> 00:17:21,510
I never saw him again.

256
00:17:21,950 --> 00:17:25,360
<i>Maybe that made him so sad, 
he didn't want any more friends.</i>

257
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:27,250
<i>That's a possibility...</i>

258
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:32,130
I don't want to go through that again.

259
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:38,640
<i>In that moment, Hananoi-kun looked
so much more tranquil than usual.</i>

260
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:45,270
<i>And to my surprise, after that, he was 
happy to keep talking about his friend.</i>

261
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:53,390
<i>He didn't strike me at all like someone
who didn't care about making friends.</i>

262
00:17:55,450 --> 00:17:56,840
Hananoi-kun?

263
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:57,510
Hmm?

264
00:17:58,100 --> 00:18:02,890
You make it sound like 
you're a bad person sometimes,

265
00:18:02,890 --> 00:18:05,410
but I don't think that's true at all.

266
00:18:05,410 --> 00:18:06,150
Oh...

267
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:09,250
You might not realize it,

268
00:18:09,250 --> 00:18:13,530
but I think you're a lot more sincere and 
a much better person than you realize.

269
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:19,230
Listen, I really so want to learn more 
and more about you, Hananoi-kun.

270
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:25,340
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't
 curious about the old you.

271
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:32,410
But the Hananoi-kun I like is 
the one with me right now.

272
00:18:33,090 --> 00:18:38,460
If you'd really rather not get into the past,
 I don't want to force you to tell me.

273
00:18:39,110 --> 00:18:41,700
S-Sincere?

274
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:42,430
Uh-huh.

275
00:18:42,750 --> 00:18:45,060
Also, Hananoi-kun,
 I think you're really cute!

276
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,440
C-Cute?!

277
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:52,640
Oh, this is a good chance! 
There's something I want to make sure of.

278
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:55,000
Um...

279
00:18:56,080 --> 00:19:01,140
Would mind closing your eyes 
and holding as still as a jizo statue?!

280
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:02,130
Uh...

281
00:19:03,470 --> 00:19:08,490
Wh-Whenever you hold me and stuff,

282
00:19:08,490 --> 00:19:13,240
my mind goes blank and I completely 
lose track of my feelings.

283
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:18,680
F-For once, I want you to let me 
try something like that on you!

284
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,700
Something like that...?

285
00:19:20,700 --> 00:19:23,330
Don't worry. It's just for confirmation.

286
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:26,670
A-All right.

287
00:19:27,050 --> 00:19:31,010
But to be honest, I don't know...

288
00:19:31,010 --> 00:19:35,140
Depending on the circumstances, 
I'm not sure I'll be able to hold back.

289
00:19:36,370 --> 00:19:39,640
I might not be able to stop 
myself like I have until now.

290
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,480
Th-That's all right!

291
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:45,690
I'm ready for it this time.

292
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:51,030
I'm so sorry. I've kept you waiting
until I knew what I was feeling.

293
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:52,910
Thank you.

294
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:19,140
<i>Just holding her hand...</i>

295
00:20:22,420 --> 00:20:23,900
<i>Just touching her...</i>

296
00:20:22,420 --> 00:20:23,900
<i>Just touching him...</i>

297
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,600
<i>It makes me feel so...</i>

298
00:20:31,170 --> 00:20:32,510
Oh, sorry!

299
00:20:32,510 --> 00:20:36,370
I-It's okay. You just surprised me.

300
00:20:39,820 --> 00:20:43,140
<i>I really do think Hananoi-kun is cute.</i>

301
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:48,340
<i>These are my true feelings 
welling up inside me.</i>

302
00:20:52,910 --> 00:20:56,020
<i>You're so cute! I like you so much!</i>

303
00:20:56,730 --> 00:20:59,820
<i>I want to touch you more. 
I want to get closer to you.</i>

304
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:16,590
Hota—

305
00:21:16,590 --> 00:21:18,710
Th-That does it!

306
00:21:18,710 --> 00:21:21,050
Thank you very much for your cooperation!

307
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:23,630
What was that?

308
00:21:26,450 --> 00:21:28,790
A... A signal...

309
00:21:55,460 --> 00:21:57,060
<i>After the pouring rain cleared,</i>

310
00:21:57,540 --> 00:22:00,120
<i>when the school fell silent
after class had ended...</i>

311
00:22:00,650 --> 00:22:02,950
<i>On this very unusual day,</i>

312
00:22:03,740 --> 00:22:07,510
<i>I had my very first kiss.</i>

